[style name="intro_fs"]
[speed=4] Dear Diary,\
\
The water carries mama's hydrangeas into the house.\
\
I make a soggy bouquet trying to save them as Mama packs our bags, but Daddy plants his feet.\
\
"Where we gonna go?" He asks.\
\
"This is our home."
